Task 2: Space Mission Astronaut Assignment System
Objective
Develop a Spring Boot application to manage Astronauts and Space Missions using a
Many-to-Many relationship.
Relationship- One Astronaut can participate in multiple Space Missions.- One Space Mission can include multiple Astronauts.
Relationship Type: @ManyToMany
Entity 1: Astronaut
Variables:- astronautId- astronautName- specialization- nationality- totalFlights
Entity 2: SpaceMission
Variables:- missionId- missionName- launchYear- destination- missionDuration
Repository Tasks
1. Save an Astronaut with multiple Space Missions.
2. Save a Space Mission with multiple Astronauts.
3. Find Astronaut by astronautName.
4. Find Mission by missionName.
5. Find all Missions assigned to a specific Astronaut.
6. Find all Astronauts participating in a specific Mission.
7. Update Mission destination.
8. Update Astronaut totalFlights.
9. Delete an Astronaut.
10. Delete a Space Mission.
11. Display all Astronauts.
12. Display all Space Missions.
Expected Join Table
astronaut_mission
astronaut_id
mission_id